   "display_name": "Creator of Mirror Clones",
   "unlock_upgrade": 0,
   "description": "Every 15 seconds:\n- Spawn a MirrorClone within this unit's range (Capacity: 3)\nMirrorClone:\n- Has 10% of this unit's current damage\n- Disappears after 3 attacks\nFor each MirrorClone spawned by this unit that is currently on the map:\n- Increase this unit's damage by 10%\n- Increase this unit's range by 10%"
