   "description": "This unit has a StormFlashMeter, starting at 0. (Capacity : 3)\nEvery 5 FollowUpAttacks from this unit or a MirrorClone will :\n- Increase StormFlashMeter by 1.\nWhen the closest allied unit in this unit's range is stunned :\n- Consume 1 StormFlashMeter stacks\n- Cleanse the Stun"
  },
